%% Collaboration 05: MIS Daily Reporting
flowchart LR
  Scheduler["Scheduler"]
  MIS["MIS Service"]
  CoreAPI["Core Banking API"]
  Warehouse["Data Warehouse"]
  ReportEngine["Report Engine"]
  Distribution["Distribution Service"]

  Scheduler -->|trigger daily MIS job| MIS
  MIS -->|extract operational data| CoreAPI
  CoreAPI -->|transaction/account dataset| MIS
  MIS -->|load normalized dataset| Warehouse
  Warehouse -->|curated reporting data| ReportEngine
  ReportEngine -->|generate MIS report pack| Distribution
  Distribution -.->|publish reports to recipients| MIS
